# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the prefill SDPA programme's oneq jobs (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a
# throwaway commit of the integration branch (a branch that carries optimisation/ttnn-op/sdpa_prefill_oneq) and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. ONE TAG AT A TIME; wait for the run to
# finish; never cancel a running card job. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. A placeholder in @...@ is filled in by whoever drives the
# window (@SERVED_IMAGE@: the served image's reference; @K64J_OQ_GRAFT_DIR@ and @K64J_OQ_TTNNCPP_SHA256@: the K64j-OQ graft directory and its binary's digest, the K64J_OQ_TTNNCPP_SHA256 line of
# L1). C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the window's own image (sed -i 's/tp4-fusion-1/<tag>/' *.env). ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the read rules and the minutes.
# Q1 (the proof and the timing, card M alone, after W1 passed): run_card_m_oq.sh over the full matrix. BYTES against the stock path: rows 2048 / 1024 / 512 x Q in DRAM and L1 x seeds 0, 1 x Q normal and
# peaky x 15 chunk starts from 0 to 251,904 (contexts 2k to 254k) x the arms served / oneq / oneq_noc; TP2's head counts (12 Q heads, 2 KV heads) at 1024 and 512 rows; the refusals; the program cache; 400
# alternating served / oneq calls; an 11x10 grid pass on the 13x10 device. TIME: stock / served / oneq / oneq_noc at eight starts (2k to 254k contexts), nine interleaved rounds, one attention layer per sample.
# READ: 'ONEQ_CARD_M verdict=PASS ... failures=0', then the 'ONEQ TIME' lines, 'ONEQ TIME_VERDICT q=dram OQ-WIN|OQ-PARTIAL|OQ-NO-WIN oneq/served=<ratio> best=oneq|oneq_noc' (WIN: median oneq/served at the
# starts of 32k and beyond at most 0.75; the estimate is 0.51 at the compute floor and 0.62 at the 16.5 us chain step Q2 measured for a 16-chain geometry), and the table: python3 -B
# optimisation/ttnn-op/sdpa_prefill_oneq/oneq_report.py <the oneq-*.json of the results> --markdown (estimated vs measured per start and per prompt: 32k, 128k and 254k solo TTFT).
# DECISION: PASS with OQ-WIN or OQ-PARTIAL -> the lever is exact on this card and worth baking (see ORDER.txt); a byte difference anywhere -> the lever stays off and the failing case names the arm and the
# shape; OQ-NO-WIN -> keep the chain as it is. If oneq_noc is the 'best', the model flag set is QWEN_FAST_SDPA_PF_FLAGS=0x7 with QWEN_FAST_SDPA_PF_ONEQ=1. Duration (estimate): 75 min (container timeout 90 min).
C2_CARDS=pair
C2_ACTIONS=cardm
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1
C2_CARDM_HARNESS=optimisation/ttnn-op/sdpa_prefill_oneq/run_card_m_oq.sh
C2_CARDM_ARGS=
C2_CARDM_ENV=IMAGE=@SERVED_IMAGE@ KOPGRAFT64=@K64J_OQ_GRAFT_DIR@ EXPECT_TTNNCPP_SHA256=@K64J_OQ_TTNNCPP_SHA256@
